	ugh Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at the TUTS Box Office\, located in the Hob
	by Center lobby. \nDiscounted group tickets are available for parties of 1
	0 or more.Theatre Under The Stars has a variety of accessibility options f
	or guests.Learn more about accessible performances and other services here
	. \nRush tickets will be available for $35 at the box office for mezzanine
	 and gallery seating starting 2 hours prior to curtain. \nQuestions about 
